\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25516-pinkhaunt","name":"PinkHaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-16T16:37:02-07:00","id":1341736,"title":"","content":"Also with how many Functions does your Toy start? Is it just one for your Affinity function and another one of your choice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25516-pinkhaunt","name":"PinkHaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T15:00:18-07:00","id":1341949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PinkHaunt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822499-conjurer-the-shattering-take-whatever?p=1341726#post1341726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have another question about the Houses of the Shattered, I think the file mentions that each one has a strategy to deal with the Abyss and that each of them has a plan for the future once they dethrone the Toymaker, but I can't seem to find it on the doc, I was hoping someone could maybe explain in broad terms about the four Great Ones at least <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the reason that you don't find them is that I am yet to write them :P I got into a creative block every time I tried. Too much of the game is still concept wise, which is why any help and suggestions would be welcomed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T04:48:48-07:00","id":1342054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822499-conjurer-the-shattering-take-whatever?p=1341949#post1341949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the reason that you don't find them is that I am yet to write them :P I got into a creative block every time I tried. Too much of the game is still concept wise, which is why any help and suggestions would be welcomed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see! Well, i'm not really really sure about it what you're planning, but since you asked for suggestions hehe I'd start with distinguishing them, stablishing the different ways they navigate the Playground, developing each House's idea of a future with no Toymaker.<br /> <br /> To stablish these points you'd need to think about how does exploring the Playground feels like. Does it looks like a Hedge-exploring thing were the Abyss has a specific agenda of leading them astray and into timelines the Toymaker knows might break a Conjurer? Or does it looks more like a Underworld exploration where there doeesn't seem to exist an active force trying to move the players to one specific region, but, staying there might begin to drain your Identity the same way the Underworld sucks Essence out of ghosts?<br /> <br /> Once you got that figured out, you could come back to the Houses and think about soe House-specific Conditions that help you navigate the Abyss and maintain your Identity, like the Agenda conditions on Demon or the Refinement conditions on Promethean ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25516-pinkhaunt","name":"PinkHaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-19T00:27:26-08:00","id":1558377,"title":"","content":"Noo, Google Doc is broken, and I found about its (previous) existence only now, after being completely enamored by this fan game from the previous forum posts! Please, someone who have copy of the document, post it yet again","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28040-namelessmyriad","name":"NamelessMyriad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}